From ripley at stats.ox.ac.uk  Thu Oct  5 06:46:13 2000
From: ripley at stats.ox.ac.uk (Prof Brian D Ripley)
Date: Thu, 05 Oct 2000 07:46:13 +0100
Subject: Re: ignored factors in anova analysis
