From: ripley at stats.ox.ac.uk (Prof Brian Ripley)
Date: Thu, 05 Oct 2000 17:48:05 +0100
Subject: Re: What are data frames, exactly?
In-Reply-To: <C89B44E6684BD411A84B0008C7BF17A40926@obelix.kispi.unizh.ch>
References: <C89B44E6684BD411A84B0008C7BF17A40926@obelix.kispi.unizh.ch>
