which I understand is part of S-Plus for Windows.

The files are at ftp://ftp.mcs.vuw.ac.nz/pub/statistics/map

There are various databases for NZ and the world.  The files with the
lowercase .l and .g extensions are the S-Plus for Windows versions.  You
also need the appropriate .N file, which is common to all versions - it
is a plain text file.

