Hi David,

If you just need the minimum distance, you can do as follows:

> test
[[1]]:
     [,1] [,2] 
[1,] 17.6   47
[2,] 17.9   49
[3,] 18.1   51
[4,] 18.4   53
[5,] 18.6   55

[[2]]:
     [,1] [,2] 
[1,] 82.6 51.5
[2,] 83.2 49.6
[3,] 83.8 47.7
[4,] 84.4 45.8
[5,] 84.9 43.9

[[3]]:
     [,1] [,2] 
[1,] 61.6 38.9
[2,] 61.9 36.9
[3,] 62.2 35.0
[4,] 62.5 33.0

> test2 <- do.call("rbind", test)
> test3 <- dist(test2)
> test3[test3 == min(test3)]
[1] 1.92354

Careful: the trick with do.call can be pretty slow if the list is very
large.

Hope this helps,

Renaud

